<title>FRANCE: GOLF-CANNES OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-CANNES OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CANNES, France 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
